-	/* convert into the ring; only the producer moves pcm_wr, and the free space checked
-	   above can only grow while we write, so the copy itself needs no lock */
-	/* s583: 12-bit mix sample (-2048..2047) * volume (0..256) / 16 fits 16 bits for
-	** VOL_MULTIPLIER 1; the old 8-bit path gave the same level with 16x coarser steps.
